{"seq":4,"slug":"platform-operations","title":"平台运营实践","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-analytics-crash-reporting/platform-operations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"analytics-sdk-integration","title":"分析 SDK 集成实践","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-analytics-crash-reporting/platform-operations/analytics-sdk-integration","wordCount":1282,"readingTime":6},{"seq":2,"slug":"data-privacy-consent","title":"数据隐私与合规","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-analytics-crash-reporting/platform-operations/data-privacy-consent","wordCount":1399,"readingTime":6},{"seq":3,"slug":"alerting-incident-response","title":"告警与应急响应","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-analytics-crash-reporting/platform-operations/alerting-incident-response","wordCount":1390,"readingTime":6}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"平台运营实践\">平台运营实践</h1><p>分析与崩溃上报系统的价值最终要在工程运营中兑现。本章从三个维度闭合整个体系：SDK 集成实践解决&quot;如何在多平台项目中正确接入分析与崩溃 SDK 并控制包体积与性能开销&quot;；数据隐私与合规应对 GDPR、ATT 等法规对数据采集的约束；告警与应急响应则将监控数据转化为可执行的行动——确保团队在问题扩散前介入。三篇文档将前三章的技术能力转化为可持续的运营闭环。</p>\n"}